  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Improving the institutional capacity for water pollution control in Vietnam</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">1. Improvements to the implementing instruments for Decree 67/2003-QD-CP and Decision 64/2003/QD-TTg. 2. Strenthening the capacity of key agencies for compliance and monitoring and evaluation of these. 3. Improving puublic awareness and participation. 4. Providing assistance to the business sector in achieving environmental compliance. The project objective is to strengthen the legal framework for water pollution control and the effectiveness of its implementation. This would be carried out through: (i) improvements to the implementing instruments for Decree 67 and Decision 64, (ii) strengthening the capacity of key agencies for compliance and monitoring and evaluation of these; (iii) improving public awareness and participation; and (iv) providing assistance to the business sector in achieving environmental compliance.</narrative>
  </description>
